<view wx:if="{{!cloudReady}}" class="cloud-gate"><view class="title">连接云端记录</view><view class="hint">{{cloudMessage}}</view><button class="primary" loading="{{cloudStatus === 'syncing'}}" disabled="{{cloudStatus === 'syncing'}}" bindtap="syncNow">重试连接</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{cloudReady}}" class="screen {{appearanceClass}}"><view class="header"><view class="title">记录，安心留存。</view><view class="subtitle">将文字和照片一起备份，换设备也能恢复。</view></view><scroll-view class="content" scroll-y="{{!restoreVisible}}"><view class="body backup-body">
  <view class="card"><view class="section-title">完整备份</view><view class="hint">生成单个 JSON 文件，包含全部记录及照片。照片原始总量最多25MB；文件请保存到小程序外，以免清除缓存时丢失。</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="exportFull">生成含照片的备份</button><block wx:if="{{backupPath}}"><view class="hint">{{backupName}}</view><button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="saveFile">导出备份文件</button></block></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-title">恢复备份</view><view class="hint">选择备份文件或粘贴 JSON，预览记录及照片后，再决定合并或完整恢复。</view><button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="openRestore">{{preview?'继续查看备份':'打开恢复备份'}}</button><view wx:if="{{fileLabel}}" class="hint">{{fileLabel}}</view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-title">从旧版迁移</view><view class="hint">在保存过旧记录的设备上预览，或选择旧版完整备份。预览不会覆盖云端记录。</view><button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="previewLegacy">检查当前设备旧记录</button></view>
</view></scroll-view>
  <view wx:if="{{restoreVisible}}" class="info-dialog-mask" catchtouchmove="stopTouch"><view class="info-dialog" aria-role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="恢复与合并备份">
    <view class="info-dialog-header"><view class="info-dialog-title">恢复与合并备份</view><button class="info-dialog-close" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="closeRestore" aria-label="关闭弹窗">×</button></view>
    <scroll-view class="info-dialog-scroll" scroll-y><view class="info-dialog-body"><view class="hint">选择已下载的 JSON 备份，或粘贴旧版导出的 JSON 文本。预览不会修改云端数据。</view>
        <button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="chooseFile">选择备份文件</button><view wx:if="{{fileLabel}}" class="hint">{{fileLabel}}</view><text class="label">或粘贴 JSON 文本</text><textarea cursor-spacing="120" class="field backup-text" value="{{text}}" maxlength="1000000" disabled="{{busy}}" bindinput="onText" placeholder="大文件请使用上方选择文件" />
        <view wx:if="{{preview}}" class="restore-preview"><view class="section-title">将恢复这些内容</view><view wx:for="{{preview.rows}}" wx:key="name" class="preview-row"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.count}} 条</text></view><view class="preview-row"><text>内嵌照片</text><text>{{preview.images}} 张</text></view><view wx:if="{{preview.missing}}" class="warning">缺失 {{preview.missing}} 张照片，仅恢复文字与仍可访问的照片。</view>
          <view class="section-title merge-title">合并到云端</view><view class="hint">新编号记录追加，相同内容去重；冲突记录需选择保留哪一份。</view><view wx:for="{{conflicts}}" wx:key="key" class="hint">{{item.name}}<view class="actions"><button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" data-choice="remote" bindtap="chooseMerge">保留云端</button><button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" data-choice="local" bindtap="chooseMerge">使用导入内容</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{conflicts.length}}" class="actions"><button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy}}" data-choice="remote" bindtap="chooseMerge">冲突全部保留云端</button><button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy}}" data-choice="local" bindtap="chooseMerge">冲突全部使用导入</button></view>
        </view></view></scroll-view>
    <view class="info-dialog-footer"><view class="actions"><button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="closeRestore">关闭</button><button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="parse">预览备份</button></view><view wx:if="{{preview}}" class="actions"><button class="danger" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="restore">完整恢复</button><button class="primary" disabled="{{busy || conflicts.length}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="mergeData">合并到云端</button></view></view>
  </view></view>
</view>

<daily-checkin-dialog />
